---
layout: base.njk
title: Segmented Bowls
permalink: /bowls/segmented/
primaryImage: /assets/images/segmented-bowls/featured.png
---

{% set images = [
  "/assets/images/segmented-bowls/featured.png",
  "/assets/images/segmented-bowls/Bowl - 6 Background Removed.png",
  "/assets/images/segmented-bowls/Bowl - 8 Background Removed.png",
  "/assets/images/segmented-bowls/Bowl - 15 Background Removed.png"
] %}

<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-8 pt-16 pb-12">
  <p class="font-ui text-sm tracking-widest uppercase text-charcoal/60 mb-3">
    <a href="{{ '/' | url }}" class="hover:text-charcoal transition-colors">Work</a> · <a href="{{ '/bowls/' | url }}" class="hover:text-charcoal transition-colors">Bowls</a> · Segmented
  </p>
  <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light text-charcoal mb-8">Segmented Bowls</h1>
  <p class="font-body text-lg text-charcoal leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
    These bowls are designed and precise. Wood species, color arrangement, and scale can be discussed on commission. Each is built to a plan but remains unique.
  </p>
</div>

<div
  x-data='{
    open: false,
    current: 0,
    images: [{% for img in images %}"{{ img | url }}"{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}{% endfor %}],
    prev() { this.current = (this.current - 1 + this.images.length) % this.images.length },
    next() { this.current = (this.current + 1) % this.images.length }
  }'
>
  {# Desktop: equal-height strip #}
  <div class="hidden md:flex w-full bg-paper" style="height: 480px;">
    {% for img in images %}
    <button
      @click="open = true; current = {{ loop.index0 }}"
      class="flex-1 overflow-hidden focus:outline-none group min-w-0 bg-paper"
    >
      {% image img, "Segmented bowl " + loop.index, "(min-width: 768px) 25vw, 100vw", "lazy", "w-full h-full object-contain transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.03]" %}
    </button>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  {# Mobile: single column #}
  <div class="md:hidden flex flex-col gap-1">
    {% for img in images %}
    <button @click="open = true; current = {{ loop.index0 }}"
            class="w-full focus:outline-none bg-paper p-4">
      {% image img, "Segmented bowl " + loop.index, "100vw", "lazy", "w-full h-auto object-contain" %}
    </button>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  {# Lightbox #}
  <div
    x-show="open"
    x-transition:enter="transition duration-200" x-transition:enter-start="opacity-0" x-transition:enter-end="opacity-100"
    x-transition:leave="transition duration-150" x-transition:leave-start="opacity-100" x-transition:leave-end="opacity-0"
    @keydown.escape.window="open = false"
    @keydown.arrow-left.window="prev()"
    @keydown.arrow-right.window="next()"
    class="fixed inset-0 flex items-center justify-center bg-blackwood/95"
    style="z-index: 10000;"
  >
    <button @click="open = false" class="absolute top-6 right-6 font-ui text-sm tracking-widest uppercase text-ground/70 hover:text-ground">✕ Close</button>
    <button @click="prev()" class="absolute left-4 md:left-10 text-ground/60 hover:text-ground font-light leading-none" style="font-size: 3rem;">‹</button>
    <button @click="next()" class="absolute right-4 md:right-10 text-ground/60 hover:text-ground font-light leading-none" style="font-size: 3rem;">›</button>
    <template x-for="(img, i) in images" :key="i">
      <img x-show="current === i" :src="img" :alt="'Segmented bowl ' + (i + 1)"
           class="max-h-[90vh] max-w-[90vw] object-contain">
    </template>
    <p class="absolute bottom-6 font-ui text-sm tracking-widest text-ground/50">
      <span x-text="current + 1"></span> / <span x-text="images.length"></span>
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="bg-blackwood py-20 px-6 text-center mt-16">
  <p class="font-display text-ground text-3xl md:text-4xl font-light mb-4">Each bowl is one of a kind.</p>
  <p class="font-body text-ash max-w-lg mx-auto mb-10 leading-relaxed">
    Wood species, color arrangement, and scale are decided in conversation. Commission a segmented bowl means co-designing something that cannot be repeated.
  </p>
  <a href="{{ '/commission/' | url }}" class="font-ui text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-ground border border-ash px-8 py-3 hover:bg-ground hover:text-blackwood transition-colors">
    Begin a Conversation
  </a>
</section>
